:: Bibliography [academic]
<div class="academic-page">
<h1>Bibliography</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Preliminary · Chicago notes-bibliography style</p>

Sources marked <span class="unverified">awaiting verification</span> have not yet been checked against a library catalogue or publisher record. Page-level citations for the historical notes are also still being verified.

<h2>Scholarly sources</h2>
<ul class="bib"><<for _k range setup.sourcesByType("scholarly")>><li><<print setup.sources[_k].chicago>><<if not setup.sources[_k].verified>><span class="unverified">awaiting verification</span><</if>></li><</for>></ul>

<h2>Primary sources</h2>
<ul class="bib"><<for _k range setup.sourcesByType("primary")>><li><<print setup.sources[_k].chicago>><<if not setup.sources[_k].verified>><span class="unverified">awaiting verification</span><</if>></li><</for>></ul>

